          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Barnaxes hee hee gwa gaás, heedaádá' aa tsu/uut gár kuwa hariím a gaasa, bar lamabu'uungw daanduwose i deer, ala heé ta gaasi ar lamabu'úngw heé wák i kaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé aa tsu/uut oo kwasleemarós taa gwa'araár i tsaát bar gár hhiintluuwós ngur tu/i ngi hanmiis ma oohara', inós aqo gaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heewo oo aa goow baraá gixsadaá tay gogoowi gár hhiintluuwós gu tuu/ ma ya/amara' kawa ota', as iwa ki/i amór do'ós bar kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú oo qoomaadá' aa gwaaiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes adoosíng aga tlehhé' yaamuuká' ta hota' iga hhitiindé'. Tseerdu birna ku'uutiyé' yaamu ngi hhitiná' ilahhooár ta haniisi ar yaamaá tawa tsu/uút harihhoó' ngir slaya' i kaahh, aqo heedaádá' aa tsu/uut kun gaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuuká' ta hota' mi hhitiimara', kuká' án niwa baraá tla/angwhúng wa hoot, asma anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ an hoót baraá tla/ángw múk Israeli wa ale.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
